Beach Conditions uses these works by other people.

fonts/     Bowlby One and Cabin, from the npm packages @fontsource/bowlby-one
           and @fontsource/cabin 5.3.0. SIL Open Font License 1.1; see
           fonts/OFL.txt.

Data, fetched when the app runs and not stored in this repository, except
tides.json:

Readings   NOAA National Data Buoy Center, https://www.ndbc.noaa.gov. Its own
           data is public domain. It also carries readings from partners,
           whose station's operator the app names when that station is picked.
Waves      Many wave readings come from CDIP, Scripps Institution of
           Oceanography, https://cdip.ucsd.edu, whose data is free for public
           use if not altered, with a link to its homepage on web displays.
           This app converts units and otherwise shows the values as sent.
Tides      NOAA Center for Operational Oceanographic Products and Services,
           https://tidesandcurrents.noaa.gov. Predictions at the closest
           station. tides.json is a shortened copy of its station list, made
           by tools/build-beach-tides.mjs.
Alerts     National Weather Service, https://www.weather.gov. Public domain.

None of these sources endorses this app. The plain-language descriptions of
water temperature and waves were written for this app and are general guidance.
